//! The game's panels drawn with the `ui` library (an immediate-mode UI with docking). The panel
//! content is the same `PanelBuilder` rows the classic tray shows, and every button routes
//! through `activate_target`, so both presentations show and do the same things.
//!
//! The status bar is fixed chrome; the six panels (Selection, Production Queue, Debug, Inspect,
//! Units, Settings) are windows the player can drag, resize, dock and put in boxes while Ctrl
//! is held. Until one is moved, `ImGuiLayoutState.plan` places it in a collision-free zone.
//! Positions are in logical pixels (the window's pixels over the DPI scale) with the origin at
//! the top-left.

